bueno, how dije anteriormente, este es un juego de desplazamiento lateral! esto quiere decir, to desplazarte es con las flechas derecha e izquierda. flecha arriba to saltar o subir escaleras, y abajo pues, to bajar!=well like I said earlier, this is a side scrolling game! This means, to move it is with the right and left arrows. Up arrow to jump or climb stairs, and down then to go down!
sabiendo esto, ya puedes moverte con tranquilidad en otros mapas! pero deja te explico otras cosas mas, that es necesario saber to tener una... le llaman buena experiencia de juego, si.=Knowing this, you can now move with ease on other maps! But let me explain other things to you, what you need to know to have one ... they call it a good gaming experience, yes.
con la letra i, puedes abrir tu inventario. en el iras almacenando los objetos that vayas recolectando en tu camino. con las flechas derecha e izquierda dentro de este, te puedes mover between sus apartados. con flecha arriba y abajo, te mueves between los objetos. si of the shift+enter about algun objeto, podras subastarlo. si, lo that escuchaste. otros jugadores podran comprar tus productos, siempre y cuando entren en sus posibilidades, claro. si solo of the enter about un item, se lo podras dar a cualquier persona that este cerca de ti. si in the hay nadie, pues es claro that in the podras dar nada, ciertoe si of the suprimir about un objeto lo tiraras al suelo. asi otras personas lo pueden recojer, o tu mismo, pulsando espacio about la coordenada donde lo tiraste. coordenadase to verlas es con la letra c. si estan habilitadas en el mapa, claro.=With the letter i, you can open your inventory. In it you will store the objects that you collect on your way. With the right and left arrows inside it, you can move between its sections. with up and down arrow, you move between the objects. if you give shift + enter on an object, you can auction it. yes, what you heard. other players will be able to buy your products, as long as they are within their means, of course. If you only enter an item, you can give it to anyone who is close to you. If there is in the one, then it is clear that you will not be able to give anything, righte if you give suppress on an object you will throw it to the ground. so other people can pick it up, or yourself, by pressing space on the coordinate where you dropped it. coordinatese to see them is with the letter c. if they are enabled on the map, of course.
to utilizar los objetos de tu inventario, solo pulsa espacio about ellos. asi accionaras sus funciones. by ejemplo, si of the espacio about un arma, la tomaras, y la tendras lista to la pelea, oo sii!=To use the objects in your inventory, just press space on them. thus you will actuate its functions. for example, if you give space on a weapon, you will take it, and you will have it ready for the fight, oo yeah!
pero aun in the is todo hecho. to utilizar tu arma necesitas recargarla. y esto lo conseguiras pulsando la letra r. ahora, tu arma is cargada y lista to ser utilizada. Si quieres dispararla, pulsas la tecla control. to ver cuantas balas le quedan, es con letra x. si in the es un arma that necesite municion, simplemente te dira that in the necesita municion.=but it's not all done yet. to use your weapon you need to reload it. and this you will achieve by pressing the letter r. now your weapon is loaded and ready to use. If you want to shoot it, you press the control key. To see how many bullets you have left, it is with the letter x. if it is not a weapon that needs ammo, it will simply tell you that it does not need ammo.
ahora. si quieres ser un experto pistolero, necesitas fijar bien a tu presa. entonces, to eso tienes that apuntarle. lo conseguiras pulsando la tecla shift, + las flechas arriba, abajo, izquierda o derecha.=now. If you want to be an expert gunman, you need to pin down your prey. So for that you have to target it. You will achieve this by pressing the shift key, + the up, down, left or right arrows.
con esto, ya podras salir a matar todo lo that se interponga en tu camino! solo unos consejos mas. si quieres explorar mapas, sin atacar o ser atacado, pulsa shift+f2. con esto activas el modo pacifista. con este modo in the podras atacar a nadie, pero nadie te podra atacar a ti. si pulsas shift+f1 activaras el modo ausente. esto te permitira estar lejos de tu computadora sin preocuparte de that tu personaje sufra algun dano. eso si, in the podras realizar ninguna accion mientras estes dentro de este modo. to desactivar tanto pacifista how modo ausente, es con las mismas combinaciones de teclas con las that se activan. con la letra l, en algunas tiendas puedes desplegar el menu de compras. con la letra h, puedes checar la hora, si tienes un reloj. con la s puedes revisar tu salud maxima, y si te han hecho dano. con la letra p, puedes ver that traes puesto de ropa, y si alguien that este cerca trae ropa, y cual trae.=With this, you can go out and kill everything that gets in your way! just a few more tips. If you want to explore maps, without attacking or being attacked, press shift + f2. with this you activate the pacifist mode. With this mode you will not be able to attack anyone, but in the one will be able to attack you. if you press shift + f1 you will activate the away mode. This will allow you to stay away from your computer without worrying about your character taking damage. Of course, you will not be able to perform any action while you are in this mode. To deactivate both pacifist and absent mode, it is with the same key combinations that they are activated. With the letter l, in some stores you can display the shopping menu. With the letter j, you can check the time, if you have a watch. with h you can check your maximum health, and if you have been harmed. With the letter p, you can see what you are wearing, and if someone nearby is bringing clothes, and which one is wearing.
tambien, si pulsas la letra v, puedes revisar tu nivel, between otras estadisticas mas de tu personaje. con alt+flechas derecha, izquierda, arriba o abajo, puedes correr en plataformas o escaleras. con la letra q, puedes sentarte. escuchaste bien, sentarte. asi descansaras de tanto correr, supongo. si tienes refrescos, al seleccionarlos en el inventario con espacio, podras utilizarlos con la letra u fuera de el. asi podras curarte del dano that te hagan los enemigos.=Also, if you press the letter v, you can check your level, among other statistics of your character. with alt + right, left, up or down arrows, you can run on platforms or stairs. with the letter q, you can sit down. you heard right, sit down. so you will rest from running, I guess. If you have soft drinks, select them in the inventory with space, you can use them with the letter u out of it. This way you can heal yourself from the damage your enemies of the to you.
